WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And I typed some letters, and I pressed enter.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Sent it. And then… I told him how to do it. Yeah, he told me how to type. And then like a day later, you know, like Cheeky10Kid showed up and went back. Yeah. Like I was, you know, typing in some…

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Carmen Cruickshank: some letters in a vending machine. Yeah, yeah. It's, like, just because I'm using… You're like, you're like, oh, I want that 10K, like, 10K is, like… Yeah, that's good. 10K came out of the vending machine. That's actually how I bought this. Not bad, you know? Not bad for zero hours of work. And that's the thing, because, like, you know, some people might even get into that position.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Carmen Cruickshank: they're crushing it for their clients. Yeah. Probably not as good as me, but, you know… They're on their way. They're on their way, you know, and I respect that, I respect the grind. Um, but then they get into that spot, and they might get the same question, and they're like.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I mean, I would be really grateful with $5. Yeah, it's like, hey, you know, 2K, uh… 2K, you know. They get a little 2K. I think the thing is, a lot of these guys don't understand that when you're working with entrepreneurs at nine figures, they're pulling 100 grand in a day. Oh, yeah. You know what I mean? So, like, 2K, 10K, 50K, what's the difference? It's all the same.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:27.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, it doesn't make it. Money is free. Like, at that level, they don't care. Yeah, it's. Especially with ecom, because in ecom, it's. It's money in, money out. Like, that's the flow of the business. Yeah, they're used to the money going in and going straight back out. It's not like info where.

